Trigram models (trigram/<lang>.txt)

The models are character-trigram statistics computed from the FrequencyWords
2018 word lists by Hermit Dave, which are built from OpenSubtitles:
https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords

FrequencyWords content is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. The models are
distributed under the same license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The Ukrainian word list was filtered with the word forms of dict_uk
(https://github.com/brown-uk/dict_uk) before the model was built.
